{"decoder":"unchanged original parseDeck/serializeDeck","items":16,"roundtrip":true,"item_id":"step-exact","answer":3,"explanation":"The exact solution is y(t)=2 exp(-t) for this initial condition and rate, so y(1)=2/e. The expression 2 - 1 ignores that the slope depends on y. It is neither the exact solution at t=1 nor the one-step forward-Euler result with h=1, which is 2-2=0."}
